{"3951360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "3-Bit Explorer", "steam_appid": 3951360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE WORLD DOESN'T NEED SAVING. YOU DO.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a cross-dimensional journey where you take control of THE EXPLORER, an accidental interdimensional traveler that needs to find his way back to his reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Move or explode obstacles away, read the minds of enemies and friends alike or teleport yourself to reach places you shouldn't be on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951360/extras/6f07634fd0b095807b8d90475f8ff329.poster.avif?t=1786648523\" width=1080 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951360/extras/6f07634fd0b095807b8d90475f8ff329.webm?t=1786648523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951360/extras/6f07634fd0b095807b8d90475f8ff329.mp4?t=1786648523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your powers change the way you approach exploration. Move objects from afar, explode obstacles, teleport across gaps and read the minds of characters to advance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951360/extras/11a45102a97f64e8fc13667defee5287.poster.avif?t=1786648523\" width=1080 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951360/extras/11a45102a97f64e8fc13667defee5287.webm?t=1786648523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951360/extras/11a45102a97f64e8fc13667defee5287.mp4?t=1786648523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world full of secrets to get lost in. Follow strange clues and question what you see. Discover things that weren't meant to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951360/extras/31ce5a805fa64641d5d957d5169c50ea.poster.avif?t=1786648523\" width=1080 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951360/extras/31ce5a805fa64641d5d957d5169c50ea.webm?t=1786648523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951360/extras/31ce5a805fa64641d5d957d5169c50ea.mp4?t=1786648523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brute force will not save you. Combat is a puzzle as well, so use your powers to paralyze, explode, read the mind and whatever else you can to gain an advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951360/extras/394a2f85cff9d2a4d2bc6b241dd0fe27.poster.avif?t=1786648523\" width=1080 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951360/extras/394a2f85cff9d2a4d2bc6b241dd0fe27.webm?t=1786648523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951360/extras/394a2f85cff9d2a4d2bc6b241dd0fe27.mp4?t=1786648523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful 1-bit and 3-bit pixel artwork made entirely by hand make the world rich and a joy to explore.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration first</strong> - This time you will explore a continent with forests, lakes, mountains and deserts, each with its own mysteries and inhabitants. Remember that there is always more than one way to reach an objective.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious atmosphere</strong> - Curiosity is your best friend in the vastness of this world. Keep in mind that your interface is not free of intrigue!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1-Bit and 3-Bit artwork</strong> - Original artwork made for the project. 2 realities meet, 1-bit and 3-bit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powers for exploration</strong> - Now you have powers granted to you by a strange spirit. Use them to reveal secrets and solve puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong> - Your destiny depends on your exploration. As with the other titles of this series, exploration unlocks hidden paths with different endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet with Deities, Spirits, Cults and much more in the vastness of this world.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn based puzzle-like combat</strong> - Brute alone force won't help you conquer the creatures of this dimension.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951360/extras/ceaae6f56d2b83bf07d5c6aa7ed9c4f9.avif?t=1786648523\" width=500 height=136 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE WORLD DOESN'T NEED SAVING. YOU DO.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a cross-dimensional journey where you take control of THE EXPLORER, an accidental interdimensional traveler that needs to find his way back to his reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Move or explode obstacles away, read the minds of enemies and friends alike or teleport yourself to reach places you shouldn't be on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951360/extras/6f07634fd0b095807b8d90475f8ff329.poster.avif?t=1786648523\" width=1080 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951360/extras/6f07634fd0b095807b8d90475f8ff329.webm?t=1786648523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951360/extras/6f07634fd0b095807b8d90475f8ff329.mp4?t=1786648523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your powers change the way you approach exploration. Move objects from afar, explode obstacles, teleport across gaps and read the minds of characters to advance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951360/extras/11a45102a97f64e8fc13667defee5287.poster.avif?t=1786648523\" width=1080 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951360/extras/11a45102a97f64e8fc13667defee5287.webm?t=1786648523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951360/extras/11a45102a97f64e8fc13667defee5287.mp4?t=1786648523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world full of secrets to get lost in. Follow strange clues and question what you see. Discover things that weren't meant to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951360/extras/31ce5a805fa64641d5d957d5169c50ea.poster.avif?t=1786648523\" width=1080 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951360/extras/31ce5a805fa64641d5d957d5169c50ea.webm?t=1786648523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951360/extras/31ce5a805fa64641d5d957d5169c50ea.mp4?t=1786648523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brute force will not save you. Combat is a puzzle as well, so use your powers to paralyze, explode, read the mind and whatever else you can to gain an advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951360/extras/394a2f85cff9d2a4d2bc6b241dd0fe27.poster.avif?t=1786648523\" width=1080 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951360/extras/394a2f85cff9d2a4d2bc6b241dd0fe27.webm?t=1786648523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951360/extras/394a2f85cff9d2a4d2bc6b241dd0fe27.mp4?t=1786648523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful 1-bit and 3-bit pixel artwork made entirely by hand make the world rich and a joy to explore.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration first</strong> - This time you will explore a continent with forests, lakes, mountains and deserts, each with its own mysteries and inhabitants. Remember that there is always more than one way to reach an objective.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious atmosphere</strong> - Curiosity is your best friend in the vastness of this world. Keep in mind that your interface is not free of intrigue!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1-Bit and 3-Bit artwork</strong> - Original artwork made for the project. 2 realities meet, 1-bit and 3-bit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powers for exploration</strong> - Now you have powers granted to you by a strange spirit. Use them to reveal secrets and solve puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong> - Your destiny depends on your exploration. As with the other titles of this series, exploration unlocks hidden paths with different endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet with Deities, Spirits, Cults and much more in the vastness of this world.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn based puzzle-like combat</strong> - Brute alone force won't help you conquer the creatures of this dimension.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951360/extras/ceaae6f56d2b83bf07d5c6aa7ed9c4f9.avif?t=1786648523\" width=500 height=136 /></span></p>", "short_description": "The world doesn't need saving. You do. Explore a strange 3-bit world, wield mysterious powers, uncover forbidden secrets, and find your way home across realities.", "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951360/6e92a1e00467516312aa30c861ee7e7115572a3e/header.jpg?t=1786648523", "